    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19344" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gausăpātus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		gausapa, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>covered with a</i> gausapa, <i>clothed
				in frieze.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mitto me in mare, quomodo psychrolutam decet,
					gausapatus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 53, 3</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>covered over</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">apri opera pistoria,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Petr. 38, 15</span></i>
			.</div>
